 `~/.ssh/known_hosts` for the service account. Provide a JSON inventory via
 `RELAY_SHELL_INVENTORY` for hosts not in `ssh_config`.
 
+Inventory lookups refresh automatically when the JSON inventory or SSH config file's
+mtime, size, or inode changes. Write registrations to a temporary file and atomically
+replace the inventory so readers see complete JSON. No service restart is needed;
+existing SSH sessions continue on their established connections. Missing or malformed
+files retain the existing empty-file behavior. This changes metadata freshness only;
+the transport, command authority, and host-key policy are unchanged.
+
